[{"title":"与赵思晏赋来青楼虽作而不与","author":"戴奎","text":"存耕道人过我游，不减雪中乘兴舟。\n浮云世事口不挂，语语索赋来青楼。\n楼中之人奇且伟，肯使馀生在泥滓。\n春风石上鼓瑶琴，夜雨灯前列图史。\n有时凭高一撚髭，汀烟沙鸟皆吾诗。\n钩帘晓挂抟桑影，钓丝晴罥珊瑚枝。\n方壶蓬岛谁解识，雾散云开翠如织。\n山势疑将度海来，岚光屡见排檐入。\n问谁于此赋诗频，哦松大笔尤清新。\n石门老翁扳桂手，湖山处士吟梅人。\n嗟予卧疴笔研废，欲作歌诗动经岁。\n神游意想一语无，几回虚作凭栏势。\n吾闻仙人好楼居，时能御风游六虚。\n尔今凡骨倘未换，大药好乞刀圭馀。\n不然买鱼仍酿术，楼头日与宾朋集。\n坐令青眼客长来，不独来青见山色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31913,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈楚宾邀登南阁出示诸公所赋诗索予继和","author":"戴奎","text":"忆别高堂凡五载，今日重游鬓毛改。\n长老惊为倒履迎，林园却似留春待。\n松间旧榻下陈蕃，席上清樽倾北海。\n是日云销天宇清，大开南阁兴纵横。\n钩帘晚峰万树出，俯槛晴坞千花明。\n少长须臾亦星聚，歌吟间作如韶鸣。\n乃知此地即仙隐，万里何必求蓬瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31914,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舍侄元明书来致当道荐拔意诗以答之","author":"戴奎","text":"郡国衣冠此日新，老怀深念竹林人。\n客边风雨十年梦，醉后乾坤万里春。\n云路尚淹麟阁远，秋天空荐鹗书频。\n不痴济叔劳推赏，奈恋烟波理钓缗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31915,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迁逐甫还次韵答舍弟文信 其一","author":"戴奎","text":"万里舆图新入贡，一时遗老复迁官。\n祗缘旧国轻周鼎，徒使仙人泣汉盘。\n斤斧未容遗朴樕，阶庭谁见长芝兰。\n野夫独幸归耕早，只恐乡关路转难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31916,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迁逐甫还次韵答舍弟文信 其二","author":"戴奎","text":"旧事纷纭成昔梦，馀生窜逐误微官。\n一年道路危三峡，几度歌吟历五盘。\n甄别有恩垂藻鉴，芬芳无德播椒兰。\n逢人但说生还喜，莫问从前事急难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31917,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临安道中别弟文美 其一","author":"戴奎","text":"拂袖归来我最先，相期耕钓在馀年。\n无端遇著东风恶，吹上长淮逐客船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31918,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临安道中别弟文美 其二","author":"戴奎","text":"三淮浪急大江回，几处惊如滟滪堆。\n我正思家行欲到，汝今那更别家来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31919,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临安道中别弟文美 其三","author":"戴奎","text":"酒尽沙头泪满裾，临当别去更踌躇。\n都忘我为儒冠误，更嘱还家课子书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31920,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高阳窥园有感 其一","author":"戴奎","text":"橘柚连云手自栽，别来谁复为封培。\n棘篱缺处秋偏早，时有邻童摘实来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31921,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高阳窥园有感 其二","author":"戴奎","text":"几畦蔬甲一长镵，记得年前草自芟。\n今日满林荆棘长，令人千里望归帆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31922,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿水馆","author":"戴奎","text":"惊雁相呼秋满江，小轩临水似艂艭。\n夜阑不寐思兄弟，风叶萧萧正打窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31923,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立秋夜泾川馆中杂兴兼怀舍弟","author":"戴奎","text":"薄暮西风生树头，坐看凉气近人浮。\n一年今日才过半，梧叶萧萧已厌秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31924,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尝稻有怀舍弟 其一","author":"戴奎","text":"晓起西风忽到门，剩炊香雪满瓷盆。\n怀人独向尝新处，含哺移时不忍吞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31925,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尝稻有怀舍弟 其二","author":"戴奎","text":"几欲因书寄土宜，溪云山霭不堪持。\n力田未足输官府，念尔徒搔两鬓丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31926,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜述怀 其一","author":"戴奎","text":"霜气横秋万木彫，月棂风牖夜萧萧。\n在家无限悲秋思，况尔别家千里遥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31927,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜述怀 其二","author":"戴奎","text":"欲凭诗句寄西风，吟到宵深语未工。\n月色如银庭树冷，一丝和露坠青虫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31928,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄衣无便","author":"戴奎","text":"秋风昨夜振庭柯，欲寄衣裘无便过。\n料汝羁愁如落叶，萧骚偏逐晚风多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31929,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一秋无舍弟手书","author":"戴奎","text":"老怀多藉得书宽，几度挑灯入夜看。\n想为眵昏怜病目，一秋无字报平安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31930,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题钱舜举所画梅花卷　　　　戴养吾","author":"戴奎","text":"千古怀人费梦思，殷勤卷赠岁寒枝。\n钱塘江上花如雪，不耐东风画角吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31931,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陶渊明田居","author":"陈伯康","text":"吾慕陶徵君，拂衣轻去就。\n栖鸟恋旧林，归云忘出岫。\n巾车返柴荆，环堵植松柳。\n东皋课种苗，南山歌种豆。\n田父时过门，葛巾与漉酒。\n五斗愧折腰，浮名果何有。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31932,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登三水钓鳌台","author":"陈伯康","text":"高哉钓鳌台，桀立几百尺。\n秋风一登临，浩荡望不极。\n吾闻苏老涧，乃是任公匹。\n投竿江海滨，长啸穹宇窄。\n古篆今莓苔，佳句馀金石。\n岁月惊逝波，山川付陈迹。\n牧童暮敲火，樵子晓吹笛。\n杖藜重夷犹，把酒缅畴昔。\n商歌正云林，天空露华白。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31933,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读史二首 其一","author":"陈伯康","text":"周公躬吐哺，四海心归仁。\n三叔乃流言，岂非骨肉亲。\n仁人视天下，万物犹一身。\n不仁身奚有，况复思弟昆。\n棠棣兴孔怀，鸱鸮念恩勤。\n圣人之所为，口实徒乱真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31934,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读史二首 其二","author":"陈伯康","text":"赵高利少主，矫制诛扶苏。\n一念误国人，三说感李斯。\n望夷眩鹿马，赤族诚天诛。\n吾闻金日磾，出身本降俘。\n霍光受遗诏，共负成王图。\n大哉社稷臣，戒之用小夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31935,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伯茂饯仲器归莱山和韵","author":"陈伯康","text":"我居西山前，君居南山下。\n居止既比邻，欢笑复杯斝。\n虽无籍籍名，亦愧栖栖者。\n吾道多艰虞，造物随取舍。\n努力少壮时，青灯共良夜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31936,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汴河堤","author":"陈伯康","text":"汴河堤，堤何长，堤中水枯堤草黄。\n锦缆牙樯不复返，车轮马迹东西忙。\n忙处多人自辛苦，过眼繁华草头露。\n文梁犹是扬州门，扬州不见琼花树。\n汴河堤，长亭路，千古光阴自朝暮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31937,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"社日","author":"陈伯康","text":"燕子来时二月天，家家祷社枫林前。\n香雾绕坛散灵雨，盂酒豚蹄候神语。\n父老殷勤拜社公，但愿今年年岁丰。\n岁丰不但衣食饱，官府租税亦了了。\n官之馀，但力田，秋报春祈得社钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31938,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铜爵台","author":"陈伯康","text":"邺中高台铸铜爵，碧瓦朱甍照城郭。\n东风吹上綵云高，君王不爱宫中乐。\n年年游幸朝复暮，夕阳忽在西陵树。\n舞影歌声逐水流，芳草萋萋迷辇路。\n穗帷尊酒空泪频，征西曩是英雄人。\n生前已敢无天命，死后终知有鬼神。\n君不见关中魂魄犹思沛，莫向西陵呼万岁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31939,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰亭","author":"陈伯康","text":"会稽内史多高情，山阴脩禊开兰亭。\n晴晖绚綵射藻井，茂林脩竹围春屏。\n山椒引泉碧云里，群贤结佩临清泚。\n羽觞随波白日迟，茧纸挥毫毕能事。\n滔滔逝水随东流，绝代衣冠成古丘。\n当时丝竹辍遗响，千年草绿空山秋。\n华胄蝉联天上客，南镇雄藩罗画戟。\n挥麈传杯坐赋诗，碧瓦朱栏换陈迹。\n今之视昔后视今，今人亦复多古心。\n人生富贵行乐矣，何用屑屑悲死生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31940,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北邙行","author":"陈伯康","text":"洛阳城北北邙山，死者葬送生者还。\n人生住世谁百年，旧鬼翻为新鬼怜。\n高坟累累卧羊虎，松下便房窜狐鼠。\n经年翁仲默有灵，夜半游魂哭相语。\n嗟尔游魂听我言，不须涕泪收尔神。\n洛阳车马日纷纶，北邙得葬能几人。\n黄金白璧买歌舞，身后无钱置抔土。\n王侯第宅多新主，那得丘山如子所。\n君不见三闾大夫葬鱼腹，葬尔北邙尔勿哭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31941,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明妃出塞图","author":"陈伯康","text":"昭君生长昭君村，汉宫选入昭阳门。\n倾城自负颜色好，薄命不得承君恩。\n朔风吹动毡车发，万里远嫁单于国。\n香梦空迷紫塞云，蛾眉愁对穹庐月。\n关山阻隔归无缘，含情掩抑鸣哀弦。\n虎头将军骨已朽，独馀青冢留千年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31942,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸿门宴","author":"陈伯康","text":"鲍鱼吹腥秦失鹿，大蛇中断神媪哭。\n函谷泥丸一旦开，轵道降人帝车覆。\n江东子弟空八千，入关有约如王言。\n三章约法慰父老，鸿门一宴聊殷勤。\n项庄酒酣拔剑舞，屠狗壮士怒裂眦。\n腰间宝玦空三回，君王不忍徒为尔。\n夜游霸上杯不胜，几踏虎尾行春冰。\n孰知大运终四百，事有天定非人能。\n咸阳宫殿火三月，玉斗无声楚歌歇。\n霸业萧条王业成，楚汉兴亡两分辙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31943,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江送别图","author":"陈伯康","text":"江河望在眼，关山渺难越。\n客子迟归期，孤棹已先发。\n天秋木叶丹，露夕芳草歇。\n美人劳我思，迢迢烟水阔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31944,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠洛阳邓知县戫之京","author":"陈伯康","text":"闻说洛阳令，三年政已成。\n循良今汉吏，风俗古周城。\n驿马云山迥，官船雪水清。\n朝回去紫阙，父老定相迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31945,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄郕县喻知县以贵","author":"陈伯康","text":"寄语郕州长，何时过洛中。\n相看两舍许，不得一尊同。\n客思瞻秋月，乡书迟早鸿。\n覃怀临别处，每憾太匆匆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31946,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄遁斋陈景明兼柬东园陈景献","author":"陈伯康","text":"君家古清友，携共阿咸游。\n远道隔千里，别怀长九秋。\n故交如梦觉，往事若云浮。\n最忆东园老，相思成白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31947,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和伯弘宗兄韵","author":"陈伯康","text":"喜共江山住，相邀不遣童。\n栖迟浮世事，寂寞古人风。\n步屦幽亭上，吟诗高阁中。\n浊醪时慰意，岂必学陶公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31948,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沚溪桥美林郎中德斋先生","author":"陈伯康","text":"牛角山阳沚溪路，溪水冬寒不可渡。\n北风几见扬沙尘，日夜奔流海东注。\n美人昼锦归故乡，飞梁压水高行步。\n郑国公孙陋乘舆，蜀中司马看题柱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31949,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阮山寺","author":"陈伯康","text":"阮郎旧隐青山里，故宅如今是佛家。\n似有天人散花雨，若为溪女饭胡麻。\n南湖秀色明春树，西崦晴光剩晚霞。\n老衲每谈因果事，红尘沧海使人嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31950,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"表侄罗师尚辟四川掾","author":"陈伯康","text":"捷音指日定成都，坐见降王属传车。\n子去惊传三语掾，人来喜得万金书。\n马嘶古栈秋风晚，舟次瞿塘夜雪初。\n若到升仙驻吟辔，不教题柱愧相如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31951,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游涌泉寺访僧不值","author":"陈伯康","text":"万石冈头紫翠围，白云㳅水护柴扉。\n石炉火冷僧初定，野径苔荒客到稀。\n绕砌山泉浮潋滟，隔江云树入霏微。\n我来岂是参禅者，笑倚长松看鹤飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31952,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游神光寺登道山亭读曾南丰先生撰碑","author":"陈伯康","text":"不见神光解吐虹，满亭苔藓旧游空。\n职方诸贡归王会，贤守遗碑见土风。\n城郭尚存人物异，江山如故古今同。\n欲将往事增惆怅，望断烟波没去鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31953,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"歌风台","author":"陈伯康","text":"高台秋日草荒凉，故老犹能说汉皇。\n歌罢三侯悲击筑，身居万乘更思乡。\n长陵魂魄风云往，原庙丹青岁月长。\n往事徒劳增感慨，寒城几度立斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31954,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜江上闻箫","author":"陈伯康","text":"西江短棹倚江干，卧听楼头玉琯残。\n歌断吴门人罢市，佩空秦馆客凭栏。\n鱼龙扰扰秋潮落，鸾凤双双夜月寒。\n听彻古今无限恨，高阳且付酒杯乾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31955,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灵峰寺","author":"陈伯康","text":"海上神山十二奇，高僧卓锡话当时。\n楼台近映黄姑水，香火犹存白马祠。\n山径岚开松桧老，石林风暖荔枝垂。\n野夫未解真如性，方外交惭惠远师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31956,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次钟南十兄韵","author":"陈伯康","text":"坐稳皋比身懒动，满庭春雨长苔衣。\n苦吟不信诗能瘦，战胜方知道解肥。\n春饤满盘堆苜蓿，砚池香水贮蔷薇。\n疏慵自乏当时望，不是孤高与俗违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31957,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄淇县胡知县原长","author":"陈伯康","text":"悠悠淇水沬之乡，无复诗人赋采唐。\n多士已谭周礼乐，郎官应选汉循良。\n花栽春雨文书静，竹送薰风枕簟凉。\n相望宜阳浑咫尺，夷门把别意何长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31958,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游西湖登宝束塔过湖山一览禅房","author":"陈伯康","text":"层层金碧耸烟霞，俯瞰楼台十万家。\n落日僧馀化城饭，频年客唤赵州茶。\n春堤杨柳看泥絮，秋水芙蓉胜雨花。\n笑我凤凰台上客，也来趺坐听楞伽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31959,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过嘉兴嘉禾驿","author":"陈伯康","text":"秀州城下水平河，桑绕长堤麦覆坡。\n义士不闻传槜李，居人犹见食嘉禾。\n且须鹦鹉杯中物，莫逐鸳鸯湖上波。\n一笑吴歈挂帆去，满天风雪奈侬何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31960,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过富春","author":"陈伯康","text":"好山犹记富春名，碧嶂清波满县城。\n越树遥连鱼浦暝，浙江低入海门平。\n客星寂寞千年事，仙棹夷犹此日情。\n试问吴侬学吴语，涌金门外好听莺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31961,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古战场","author":"陈伯康","text":"此地曾经几战尘，离离荒草不生春。\n平沙日落黄云断，燐火如星出近人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31962,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立夏喜晴","author":"陈伯康","text":"剩雨残春送五更，晴光入夏似相迎。\n绿槐门巷南薰细，又听新蝉第一声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31963,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过草亭","author":"陈伯康","text":"池上柳枝新种得，丝丝金缕曳春晖。\n乐天老去风流减，懒看飞花上舞衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31964,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过洛阳","author":"陈伯康","text":"甲马营中紫气消，铜驼巷陌草萧萧。\n何人共看天津月，杜宇无声夜寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31965,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过淮北","author":"陈伯康","text":"长淮岸北驻征骖，山色回看净若蓝。\n为问故乡何处是，三千里外隔江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31966,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饯中书写诰赵彦珍","author":"陈伯康","text":"奉天锦诰出黄麻，五色晴云绚紫霞。\n綵笔承恩香染处，掖垣初日上葵花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31967,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送代北镇抚沈将军","author":"陈伯康","text":"代北山南十八州，雁门关顶四时秋。\n沈郎带眼浑依旧，领得千军紫塞游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31968,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"陈完","text":"久忆故人情，兹焉发幽兴。\n抱琴渡危桥，望入藤萝径。\n溪雨倏已晴，云收千嶂净。\n乔木生晚凉，松涛满清听。\n之子不我逢，隔篱鸡犬静。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31969,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水","author":"陈完","text":"危峰倚白云，秀气横清秋。\n俯见岷蜀晚，仰观河汉㳅。\n朝日海上出，苍然蔼林丘。\n阳崖散金碧，阴壑晴光浮。\n中有飧霞客，母乃仙侣俦。\n我欲一见之，道远从无由。\n安得同心人，携手穷冥搜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31970,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖山佳趣图","author":"陈完","text":"微雨息市氛，晴光溢水木。\n暂辍童冠书，少豁林泉目。\n峨哉南北峰，影浸西湖绿。\n岭外号长松，霞边起孤鹜。\n荷香隐綵舟，鸟鸣迓丝竹。\n兴并坡老游，吟步逋仙躅。\n落日度寒钟，悠然自天竺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31971,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送虞大令之广济","author":"陈完","text":"六月暑气盛，炎云朝夕生。\n居家苦蒸郁，况有千里行。\n畴昔在家林，子时方秀发。\n相去二十年，老我之华发。\n子行固不遥，宰邑蕲阳间。\n蕲民待新政，称治良独难。\n乃祖旧龚黄，贤孙今卓鲁。\n昭哉循吏传，视今犹视古。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31972,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送方教授之樵城","author":"陈完","text":"飞雪迷川陆，寒飙鸣树巅。\n连镳出白下，送子归樵川。\n忆昨东观游，同心复同调。\n穷窥秘阁书，载发金门笑。\n大典时云毕，对酒成别离。\n孤舟日东逝，后会竟何时。\n君采泮水芹，我弄玉堂月。\n曷以摅所怀，鳞鸿未应辍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31973,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与陈司训桃林之会","author":"陈完","text":"南飙扫朝云，大日鸣穹昊。\n宗盟列玳筵，入我城东道。\n伟兹汗漫期，况是同乡好。\n林深酒气香，叶密蝉声噪。\n暂陪簪绂游，恍若篷莱到。\n何当驻残阳，为君倒怀抱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31974,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"爱日堂为秋官李主事作","author":"陈完","text":"冬日既苦短，夏日孰云长。\n流光逐逝波，崦嵫倏扶桑。\n眷言堂上人，秋鬓双垂素。\n志养期无违，岂在罗三釜。\n盻彼反哺乌，哑哑鸣树颠。\n微物尚有情，子职宁或愆。\n亲寿逮期颐，载喜还载惧。\n去日不可追，来日何由驻。\n安得鲁阳戈，为我延夕晖。\n誓将日为岁，庶以伸吾私。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31975,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]